Purpose, export and radio compliance

Navigation Index is provided for research, education and resilience purposes: navigation of
small autonomous vehicles, integrity monitoring, detection of GNSS interference, and safe
operation when GNSS is degraded. It contains no targeting, terminal guidance or payload logic.

Navigation code is dual-use. You are responsible for complying with the export-control,
sanctions and radio regulations that apply where you use, modify or distribute this material.
The GNSS signal-generation sample works on IQ files only and opens no SDR device. Do not
transmit GNSS or other radio signals over the air without the authorisation your
jurisdiction requires. Fly only under the
drone rules that apply to you.

